  "details": "SDK no longer give you a warning about being in play mode when you try to build content. It only throws an error in the logs. This happens in 3.8.1-beta.1 as well.\n\nThis one to be more exact -> NullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object\n\n1. In a project, enter playmode.\n\n2. Click build in the SDK.\n\n3. check the logs.\n\nVideo showing problem: https://youtu.be/EXTIGPi8RxI",
